# internOS project-level .gitignore
#
# Lives at a project root (e.g. `<workspace>/projects/<project>/.gitignore`).
# The project repo tracks project-scoped internOS state ONLY — code repos
# (services, products, libraries) live as sibling subdirectories inside the
# project and each have their own .git. Allowlist style: ignore everything,
# then re-include the internOS file shapes this repo is allowed to track.
#
# Update when the framework adds a new project- or workstream-level file
# shape.

# Ignore everything at the project root by default.
/*

# Re-include the canonical project-level internOS files.
!/.gitignore
!/PROJECT.md
!/TICK.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/README.md
!/docs/
!/workstreams/

# Inside workstreams/, allowlist the canonical per-workstream files. Any
# scratch artifact, generated output, or nested code repo inside a workstream
# stays untracked unless explicitly re-included below.
workstreams/*/*
!workstreams/*/BRIEF.md
!workstreams/*/STATUS.md
!workstreams/*/MEMORY.md
!workstreams/*/DECISIONS.md
!workstreams/*/STAKEHOLDERS.md
!workstreams/*/RESOURCES.md
!workstreams/*/SESSIONS.md
!workstreams/*/ONBOARDING.md
!workstreams/*/README.md
!workstreams/*/docs/
